    "description": "\u201cWe don\u2019t believe in becoming a power broker\u201d-Dilith Jayaweera, Leader of Sarvajana Balaya",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/hard-talk/We-dont-believe-in-becoming-a-power-broker-Dilith-Jayaweera-Leader-of-Sarvajana-Balaya/334-350255",
