    "md5": "34fbe5cc6f8f53d6e42e1bd1fec3eb04",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1057,
    "chunk_text": "For owners of high-value vehicles, the choice of Genuine spare parts can have a significant impact on long-term vehicle performance and durability. Genuine spare parts are specifically designed to meet the specifications of the respective vehicle, helping ensure compatibility, reliability and consistent performance. This is particularly important for vehicles within their warranty period, and thereafterwhere using the appropriate genuine components can help protect the vehicle and the investment made by the owner.\n\nThe premium showroom environment is also intended to reflect the quality and credibility associated with the Euro Motors brand portfolio, giving customers greater confidence when sourcing parts for their vehicles. With its combination of genuine parts, bundle offers, easy ordering and doorstep delivery, the relaunched Euro Motors Spare Parts Showroom provides a more seamless way for customers to maintain their vehicles with the right components, helping protect their investment and ensure dependable performance over the long term."
