    "description": "Sri Lankan Corporate Health & Productivity Awards 2026 launched",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Sri-Lankan-Corporate-Health-Productivity-Awards-2026-launched/273-350308",
    "lang": "en",
