    "md5": "3e823eee47abd909f25f1bd32ee28b85",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1455,
    "chunk_text": "HNB retains Euromoney recognition as SL\u2019s Best Bank for Large Corporates\n\nHNB Senior Vice President and Head of Corporate Banking Manojith Weerasuriya accepts the award\n\nHNB PLC received the Best Bank for Large Corporates in Sri Lanka 2026 award at the Euromoney Awards for Excellence, marking the second consecutive year that the bank has secured the prestigious international recognition.\n\nThe award was accepted on behalf of HNB by Senior Vice President and Head of Corporate Banking Manojith Weerasuriya, reflecting the bank\u2019s continued progress in supporting Sri Lanka\u2019s largest corporates, multinational companies, exporters and infrastructure developers with increasingly sophisticated financial solutions.\n\nEuromoney\u2019s recognition builds on HNB\u2019s expanding capabilities across corporate lending, project finance, transaction banking, trade services and cross-border financing. HNB was also named the Best Bank for Large Corporates in Sri Lanka by Euromoney in 2025.\n\nDuring the award review period, HNB participated in several landmark transactions that demonstrated the increasing breadth of its corporate banking proposition. These included participation in the US $ 1 billion sustainability-linked syndicated financing for Aster Chemicals & Energy, cross-border acquisition financing involving Surge Global and Calcey Technologies and the arrangement of Rs.44.5 billion in syndicated financing for the 350MW Sobadhanavi power project."
  },
