    "chunk_text": "Dwibedi also pointed to Sri Lanka\u2019s reviving tourism sector as an underutilised springboard for global brand trial and digital customer acquisition. Recounting his personal habit of purchasing local herbal wellness remedies, such as the herbal tea sachets for sore throats, during visits to the island, he highlighted how the tourist footfall can initiate a broader international discovery cycle.\n\nTo navigate the immediate domestic headwinds while preparing for foreign expansion, Dwibedi advised the retailers to adopt the asset-light digital marketplace models abroad, invest in daily supply chain visibility and auto-replenishment and embed artificial intelligence into product discovery to protect margins and retain customer loyalty."
