    "chunk_text": "GHR Chairman Dasun Wickramarathna said, \u201cFor over 20 years, GHR has strived to push the boundaries of what property development can achieve in Sri Lanka. As pioneers who introduced the hotel residency concept back in 2016, our mission has always been clear: to provide high-yield investment opportunities for our clients while taking Sri Lanka\u2019s condominium industry into a new frontier.\n\nJayasuriya said, \u201cThroughout my life, I have always believed in vision, commitment and backing pioneers who are not afraid to change the game. GHR has proven time and again that they are true visionaries in Sri Lanka\u2019s real estate market, especially with their trailblazing work in hotel residencies.\n\nGHR is on the verge of unveiling a truly extraordinary high-rise landmark along the southern coast. This project is going to set a new standard for luxury living and investment in Sri Lanka.\u201d\n\nWith an expanding hotel residency portfolio spanning from Negombo, Sigiriya, Nuwaraeliya, Hikkaduwa, GHR is looking to expand towards Sri Lanka\u2019s southern coast as the next growth stage to meet the demand created by the tourism sector."
