    "chunk_text": "Chinese envoy meets Ranil\n\nA meeting was held between newly appointed Chinese Ambassador to Sri Lanka Wei Huaxiang and former President Ranil Wickremesinghe at Wickremesinghe\u2019s political office on Flower Road today. Chinese Deputy Ambassador Zhu Yanwei, Counsellor Mei Jing and Third Secretary Jin Enze also attended the meeting."
