    "chunk_text": "The SJB which had initiated the Galle Face struggle with a militant march to the Presidential Secretariat and a speech by Sajith challenging Gotabaya, failed to serve as a Premadasa-ist populist Opposition when Ranil\u2019s harsh austerity policy was massively alienating people. SJB\u2019s Harsha and Eran urged\u2014and cheered\u2014\u201cpainful\u201d reforms. Sajith failed to veto them and override their line.\n\nAKD and the JVP-NPP moved into the breach opened by the SLPP and SJB.\n\nWith Namal\u2019s imprisonment, Mahinda\u2019s symbolic reappearance and the Anuradhapura fightback, the SLPP is rejuvenated. The SJB is reactivated. The two democratic pillars have re-emerged. The JVP-NPP\u2019s space has structurally shrunk. The 2024 \u2018moment\u2019 is over."
