    "description": "3M\u2013McLarens host second Occupational Health & Safety symposium",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/3MMcLarens-host-second-Occupational-Health-Safety-symposium/273-350482",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
    "time_ut": 1789621750.0,
    "chunk_id": "2026-09-17-dailymirrorlk-243ff70b-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "01697c5984342ab9c728bc1aeccca42e",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1585,
    "chunk_text": "3M\u2013McLarens host second Occupational Health & Safety symposium\n\nFor the second consecutive year, 3M\u2013McLarens, hosted the 3M\u2013McLarens Occupational Health & Safety Symposium 2026, under the theme \u2018Cultivating Healthy Minds for a Stronger, Safer Workplace,\u2019 at Monarch Imperial recently.\n\nThe 2026 edition placed a particular focus on the connection between mental well-being and physical workplace safety, drawing on global trends and evolving international standards in occupational health and safety.\n\nThe symposium provided participants with practical strategies to manage everyday stressors and psychological pressures, while highlighting the importance of creating resilient, supportive and psychologically sound workplaces.\n\nThe event brought together cross-industry leaders from the public and private sectors, occupational health and safety professionals, and thought leaders from 3M and the McLarens Group.\n\nCommenting on the significance of the event, Dilan Seneviratne, Director/CEO of 3M-McLarens said, \u201cFollowing the benchmark set during our inaugural symposium, returning for a second consecutive year reinforces our long-term dedication to elevating workplace standards across Sri Lanka. Safety extends beyond physical protective equipment; it begins with the mind. By focusing on cultivating healthy psychosocial environments, we empower employees to feel supported, secure, and focused. At 3M\u2013McLarens, our mission remains clear: combining global scientific innovation with practical expertise to build safer, stronger, and more resilient organizations.\u201d"
  },
