    "description": "LB Finance sets new benchmark with South Asia\u2019s first carbon neutral annual report microsite",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/LB-Finance-sets-new-benchmark-with-South-Asias-first-carbon-neutral-annual-report-microsite/273-350483",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
    "time_ut": 1789621830.0,
    "chunk_id": "2026-09-17-dailymirrorlk-7c95c054-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "3a2aa040207352678ed0d61c6e66bf26",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1666,
    "chunk_text": "LB Finance sets new benchmark with South Asia\u2019s first carbon neutral annual report microsite\n\nGoing beyond conventional digital reporting, LB Finance has undertaken a structured process to measure, reduce and offset the emissions associated with the microsite, integrating environmental responsibility into its digital innovation journey.\n\nThis initiative reflects the company\u2019s broader commitment to embedding sustainability considerations into the way it operates, innovates and communicates with stakeholders.\n\nAs a result, LB Finance has set a new benchmark in South Asia by achieving carbon neutrality for its Annual Report microsite, the first of its kind in the region.\n\nThe microsite was developed in partnership with Arimac Lanka (Pvt) Ltd, while Control Union Inspections (Pvt) Ltd independently verified its carbon neutrality, strengthening the transparency and credibility of the achievement. This milestone positions LB Finance at the forefront of environmentally responsible digital reporting and demonstrates how innovation and sustainability can move forward together.\n\nThe carbon neutrality journey began with a comprehensive assessment of the GHG emissions generated through the development of the Annual Report microsite.This process was guided by internationally recognized sustainability principles and frameworks, ensuring a structured and credible approach to carbon accounting.\n\nImportantly, LB Finance went beyond simply offsetting emissions. Priority was given to identifying opportunities to minimize emissions during the microsite development process, with only the remaining unavoidable emissions addressed through carbon offsetting."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
    "doc_id": "2026-09-17-dailymirrorlk-7c95c054",
    "num": "dailymirrorlk-7c95c054",
    "date_str": "2026-09-17",
    "description": "LB Finance sets new benchmark with South Asia\u2019s first carbon neutral annual report microsite",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/LB-Finance-sets-new-benchmark-with-South-Asias-first-carbon-neutral-annual-report-microsite/273-350483",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
    "time_ut": 1789621830.0,
