    "description": "\u201cI\u2019m a Tiger but not an LTTE Tiger\u201d - Archchuna",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Im-a-Tiger-but-not-an-LTTE-Tiger-Archchuna/108-350551",
