    "chunk_size_bytes": 769,
    "chunk_text": "Court recalls warrants on Aravinda de Silva, wife\n\nColombo Fort Magistrate yesterday ordered the recall of warrants issued a day earlier on former Sri Lankan cricketer Aravinda de Silva and his wife, who had stood as sureties for the wife of Airbus bribery case suspect the late Kapila Chandrasena.\n\nCounsel representing de Silva and his wife appeared before court by way of a motion, submitting that the couple had been unable to appear the previous day due to funeral arrangements for de Silva\u2019s mother.\n\nConsidering the submissions, the Magistrate ordered the warrants on de Silva and his wife to be recalled.\n\nThe late Chandrasena is a suspect in the alleged payment of a $ 2 million bribe in connection with the purchase of Airbus aircraft by SriLankan Airlines."
