    "chunk_text": "The December program will also bring an international dimension through UK-based Sri Lankan professionals Deena Tissera and Lushani Kodituwakku, alongside local business and leadership figures chairing the three initiatives.\n\nSegera said the three platforms ultimately seek to take Sri Lankan business achievement beyond domestic recognition and position the country\u2019s talent, entrepreneurs and corporate practices against international benchmarks.\n\n\u201cThe world is no longer competing on quantity alone; it is competing on value, innovation, quality, talent and the ability to think beyond borders,\u201d she said.\n\n\u201cSri Lanka must prepare to compete, lead and make its mark \u2014 we simply cannot afford to be left behind.\u201d"
