    "md5": "2cee8f4851b7d99667aa363a2a1008ad",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1422,
    "chunk_text": "Payable launches Payments.lk gateway\n\nTakes on traditional payment gateways by offering zero monthly fees, lowest published rates Payable, Sri Lanka\u2019s largest payments aggregator, has launched Payments.lk, a new payment gateway designed to make accepting digital payments simpler, cheaper and more accessible for the Sri Lankan businesses of all sizes.\n\nFor years, the businesses in the country have had to work around the economics of legacy payment gateways that are known for setup fees, monthly charges, complicated pricing and better rates often reserved for larger merchants.\n\nPayments.lk is built differently, as there are no setup fees, no monthly fees, no minimum commitments and no fixed per-transaction charges.\n\nThe local card rates start from 2.29 percent, while LankaQR and LankaPay payments start from 0.99 percent. Payments.lk has also been designed to offer the lowest published standard rates in the market across its core pricing bands, while removing the recurring costs traditionally associated with payment gateways.\n\nPayments.lk is intended for more than established companies. The platform is designed for start-ups, SMEs, online sellers, freelancers, entrepreneurs and licensed professionals, giving a much broader segment of the market access to digital payments.\n\nDoctors, lawyers, accountants, consultants and other eligible professionals can also apply using their professional registration."
  },
