    "chunk_size_bytes": 864,
    "chunk_text": "LB Finance completes incorporation of Philippine subsidiary\n\nLB Finance PLC yesterday announced it completed the incorporation of its wholly owned subsidiary in the Philippines, marking the company\u2019s entry into the Southeast Asian financial services market.\n\nThe subsidiary, LB Finance Philippines Inc., received its Certificate of Incorporation and authority to operate as a finance company dated September 1, 2026, LB Finance said in a disclosure to the Colombo Stock Exchange yesterday.\n\nThe documents were received by the Sri Lankan non-bank financial institution on September 17.\n\nThe move follows approval granted by the Central Bank of Sri Lanka in December 2025 for LB Finance to establish the subsidiary with an initial investment of US$ 650,000.\n\nLB Finance had earlier said the Philippine operation would engage in the provision of financial services."
  },
