    "description": "Former envoy urges govt. to conclude US trade pact to lock in 10% tariff",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/Former-envoy-urges-govt-to-conclude-US-trade-pact-to-lock-in-10-tariff/215-350587",
