    "md5": "c2d9bea3980419632d1090e8185a74e9",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2000,
    "chunk_text": "Jetour Owners\u2019 Club  Sri Lanka officially launched with drive fest\n\nA new chapter in Sri Lanka\u2019s automotive community was marked with the official launch of the Jetour Owners\u2019 Club Sri Lanka, as more than 70 Jetour owners came together for the inaugural Drive Fest 2026, celebrating their passion for adventure, driving, and the growing Jetour family.\n\nThe landmark event commenced at the iconic Lotus Tower, Colombo, where participants gathered with their vehicles before embarking on a scenic convoy drive to Water\u2019s Edge, Battaramulla across several landmarks in Colombo such as the Galle Face Green, Green Path and Borella.\n\nThe event brought together Jetour enthusiasts from across the country, creating an unforgettable experience filled with camaraderie, excitement, and shared appreciation for the prestigious automobile brand.\n\nOrganized under the theme \u201cDrive Together. Explore Together. Create Memories Together.\u201d, the Drive Fest served as a platform to officially launch the Jetour Owners\u2019 Club in Sri Lanka while strengthening the bond between owners and the brand.\n\nThe event was proudly sponsored by Euro Motors, the official sole agent for Jetour vehicles in Sri Lanka, whose continued commitment to enhancing the ownership experience has contributed significantly to the rapid growth of the Jetour community in the country.\n\nParticipants enjoyed a memorable day of driving, networking, and recreational activities, highlighting the spirit of exploration and adventure that defines the Jetour brand. The convoy journey from Colombo to Battaramulla turned heads along the route, showcasing an impressive lineup of Jetour vehicles and reflecting the growing popularity of the brand among Sri Lankan motorists.\n\nSpeaking at the event, organizers emphasized that the formation of the Jetour Owners\u2019 Club is aimed at creating a vibrant platform where owners can connect, exchange experiences, participate in exclusive events, and celebrate their shared passion for driving."
  },
