    "chunk_text": "Hotel employee opens fire with air rifle during Kegalle party\n\nKegalle, Sep 19 (Daily Mirror)- A person was injured after a hotel employee allegedly opened fire with an air rifle during a party at a hotel in Kegalle town last night (18), police said.\n\nAccording to the Police Media Division, an argument that broke out during the party had escalated, resulting in a tense situation at the hotel.\n\nPreliminary investigations have revealed that the hotel employee had fired the air rifle while attempting to control the situation arising from the dispute, police said.\n\nThe injured person was admitted to the Kegalle Teaching Hospital for treatment.\n\nThe Kegalle Police are conducting further investigations into the incident."
