    "chunk_text": "Ranil unveils programme for Sri Lanka\u2019s future\n\nColombo, September 19 (Daily Mirror) - Former President Ranil Wickremesinghe today unveiled a new programme which he described as a plan for the future of Sri Lanka.\n\nThe programme proposes a new Constitution and a new electoral system under which 125 Members of Parliament would be elected from electorates.\n\nWickremesinghe said discussions were being held with all political parties, excluding the National People\u2019s Power (NPP), to work towards a common national agenda.\n\nHe said the responsibilities under the proposed programme would ultimately be handed over to the younger generation.\n\n\u201cResponsibilities under this programme will be handed over to the younger generation,\u201d he said."
