    "description": "Trump bans CNN, MSNBC and Politico from White House over \u2018fake news\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Trump-bans-CNN-MSNBC-and-Politico-from-White-House-over-fake-news/108-350711",
    "lang": "en",
