    "chunk_text": "A blessing from the skies\n\nAmid the ongoing dry weather, a Sri Lanka Air Force Y-12 aircraft took to the skies carrying blessed Pirith water, which was dispersed over the land as a symbolic prayer for rain and relief. The gesture expressed hopes for much-needed rainfall and relief for communities, animals, trees and other living beings affected by the heat and drought.\n\nMonsoon Lessons: What the rains teach Sri Lanka about resilience"
