    "md5": "8f6a4e37704cd233a3f27274030d9325",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1341,
    "chunk_text": "Commercial Bank crowned SL\u2019s Best Bank and Best ESG Bank by Euromoney\n\nCommercial Bank of Ceylon has secured two of the most coveted accolades at the Euromoney Awards for Excellence 2026, winning the titles of \u2018Best Bank in Sri Lanka\u2019 and \u2018Best ESG Bank in Sri Lanka\u2019 ina dual triumph directly rooted in its deeply embedded Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) principles.\n\nIn conferring the title of Best Bank in Sri Lanka, Euromoney highlighted Commercial Bank\u2019s ability to combine scale, profitability and system-wide impact in a year of economic recovery, proving that purpose-driven ESG commitments actively power financial excellence.Euromoney notedthe Bank\u2019s industry-leading financial performance in 2025 with profit before tax exceeding Rs. 89.38 billion and total assets reaching Rs. 3.26 trillion. The Bank also maintained strong capital and funding positions, alongside a robust return on equity of 19.5 percent and one of the lowest cost-to-income ratios in the market.\n\nJustifying this recognition, the Bank demonstrated exceptional growth and market leadership, with loans surpassing Rs. 2.028 trillion and total assets expanding by 16.8 percent. It also became the first Sri Lankan bank to exceed US$ 1 billion in market capitalisationas ESG-focused operations continued to reinforce investor confidence."
  },
