    "date_str": "2026-09-21",
    "description": "Sri Lanka navigates path to implement  out-of-country voting",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/news-features/Sri-Lanka-navigates-path-to-implement-out-of-country-voting/131-350764",
    "lang": "en",
