    "chunk_text": "Southern Expressway bus crash injures over 10\n\nMore than 10 people have reportedly been hospitalised following a collision involving a bus and several vehicles on the Southern Expressway this morning.\n\nThe accident occurred between the Gelanigama and Dodangoda interchanges when a bus travelling from Matara to Colombo collided with several other vehicles.\n\nMore than 10 people injured in the accident have reportedly been admitted to hospital for treatment."
