    "description": "Supreme Court rules transit passengers subject to Customs jurisdiction",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Supreme-Court-rules-transit-passengers-subject-to-Customs-jurisdiction/108-350794",
