    "time_ut": 1790052696.0,
    "chunk_id": "2026-09-22-dailymirrorlk-67b4dd13-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "5cdfb94348cf2c4c236a11cfd78af87f",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1712,
    "chunk_text": "Pan Asia EZY revolutionises digital banking in Sri Lanka\n\nBuilt around you and built for more, new platform puts everyday banking at customers\u2019 fingertips\n\nPan Asia Bank has launched Pan Asia EZY, its next-generation digital banking platform built around the changing customer needs and the simple proposition of making people\u2019s lives EZY, so they can do more.\n\nDesigned for both digital-first customers and the bank\u2019s existing customer base, Pan Asia EZY brings everyday banking, payments and selected financial services together in one mobile platform.\n\nThe proposition \u2018Built around you. Built for More\u2019, reflects the bank\u2019s focus on giving the customers greater convenience, control and flexibility in managing their finances.\n\nThe customers can check balances, transfer funds, pay bills and make QR payments through the app, while JustPay enables transfers from accounts held at other banks. They can also top up their Pan Asia Bank accounts and manage routine financial transactions without visiting a branch.\n\nThe platform also introduces greater digital convenience for specific customer needs. The pawning customers can repay, renew and top up their facilities through the app, while the fixed deposit customers can access real-time cashback loans when they require additional financial flexibility. Through GovPay, the customers can also settle payments including traffic fines and Inland Revenue Department payments.\n\nPan Asia EZY has been developed with everyday customer behaviour in mind. The users can choose to hide or display account balances, save favourite beneficiaries and billers with preferred payment amounts and receive payment reminders through push notifications and email."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
