    "chunk_text": "Dialog unveils South Asia\u2019s 1st 5G eSIM MiFi\n\nDialog Axiata PLC, Sri Lanka\u2019s #1 connectivity provider, has introduced South Asia\u2019s first 5G MiFi with eSIM capability and Wi-Fi 6 technology, offering a powerful portable internet solution for ultra-fast and reliable connectivity on the move.\n\nThe launch strengthens Dialog\u2019s leadership in next-generation connectivity, powered by Sri Lanka\u2019s largest and fastest-growing 5G network, with over 1,000 live 5G sites across all 25 districts.\n\nDesigned for professionals, businesses, students, travellers and families, Dialog 5G Ultra MiFi delivers fast and reliable internet wherever users live, work or travel.\n\nThe compact plug-and-play device is ideal for remote work, business travel, temporary workspaces and backup internet needs, while extending high-speed connectivity to locations where fixed broadband may be unavailable.\n\nAs South Asia\u2019s first 5G MiFi with eSIM capability, the device supports both the Dialog 5G Ultra and 4G networks. Equipped with advanced Wi-Fi 6 technology, it supports up to 16 connected devices simultaneously, while its 5000mAh battery delivers up to 16 hours of continuous use.\n\nType-C USB connectivity provides added flexibility for internet access across laptops, tablets, smartphones and other Wi-Fi-enabled devices. The launch further strengthens Dialog\u2019s position as Sri Lanka\u2019s leading eSIM innovator. Building on pioneering services such as eSIM One Number and eSIM Quick Transfer, Dialog continues to make connected experiences simpler, smarter and more seamless for the customers."
  },
