    "chunk_text": "patpat.lk wins Gold at BestWeb.LK Awards 2026\n\npatpat.lk, Sri Lanka\u2019s digital marketplace, has been awarded Gold for Best Mobile User Experience \u2013 Advertising and Marketing at the BestWeb.LK Awards 2026, organised by LK Domain Registry.\n\nThe recognition reflects patpat.lk\u2019s continued focus on delivering a simple, intuitive and engaging digital experience for users across Sri Lanka.\n\nThe platform connects buyers and sellers across a wide range of categories, including vehicles, property, electronics and more, enabling users to discover products, explore options and connect with sellers through a convenient digital marketplace.\n\nThe BestWeb.LK Awards recognise excellence in Sri Lanka\u2019s digital landscape, celebrating websites and digital experiences that demonstrate creativity, innovation, functionality and quality.\n\nFurther strengthening its performance at the awards, patpat.lk was also recognised with a Silver Award for Best Advertising and Marketing Website, highlighting the strength of its overall digital presence and marketing efforts. Commenting on the achievement, Amritha Allahakkon, Head of Products at patpat.lk, said, \u201cWe are proud to receive the Gold Award for Best Mobile User Experience. This recognition is a reflection of the team\u2019s continued focus on making the platform simpler and more convenient for our users.\u201d"
