    "md5": "d4fd8345131b6039575d3efbcfec5fd6",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 718,
    "chunk_text": "Organized by ITF and hosted by NUSS, the conference will feature keynote addresses from international labour leaders, technical sessions, and panels addressing the practical implications of AI adoption in maritime and transport sectors.\n\n\u201cThis conference represents a monumental moment in time as AI emerges as a key part of current and future life, as we know it. NUSS is honoured to host this historic event in Colombo, reinforcing our pivotal role in global seafaring and transport,\u201d said CEO Boa Athu, National Union of Seafarers Asia Pacific.\n\n\u201cAI offers transformative potential when guided by strong social dialogue, equitable access to training, and robust safeguards for governance.\u201d he further added."
