    "md5": "d2795a702c50a0b1ba4b45b2f7eab923",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1007,
    "chunk_text": "DBL introduces Dongcheng hand tools\n\nDongcheng has expanded its footprint in Sri Lanka, with the launch of its hand tools range, broadening its product portfolio beyond power tools and targeting the country\u2019s construction, hardware and professional trades sectors.\n\nThe range was officially unveiled recently in Colombo, in conjunction with the Constructor 2026 exhibition, by local distributor Deen Brothers Imports (DBL) Private Limited.\n\nFormer Sri Lankan cricketer Sanath Jayasuriya attended the launch as the chief guest, alongside representatives from the construction, hardware and machinery industries, dealers, business partners and other stakeholders.\n\nThe new range is aimed at professional tradespeople and construction industry users, with products focused on quality, efficiency, reliability and practical performance.\n\nThe introduction of hand tools complements Dongcheng\u2019s existing power tools portfolio and is expected to strengthen the brand\u2019s presence in Sri Lanka\u2019s tools market."
