    "description": "SLIIT Int\u2019l-Liverpool John Moores University inaugurate learning facility in Colombo",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/SLIIT-Intl-Liverpool-John-Moores-University-inaugurate-learning-facility-in-Colombo/273-350929",
