    "description": "LMFN chief urges microfinance sector to embrace regulation as ally of growth",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/LMFN-chief-urges-microfinance-sector-to-embrace-regulation-as-ally-of-growth/273-350936",
