    "description": "Easter Sunday Attack Verdict:  More a moment of reckoning than a closure",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Easter-Sunday-Attack-Verdict-More-a-moment-of-reckoning-than-a-closure/172-350942",
